cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "GovDataHub — Open Government Dataset Catalogs"
message: "If you use these catalogs, please cite them as below."
type: dataset
authors:
  - given-names: Asher
    family-names: Caulfield
identifiers:
  - type: url
    value: https://github.com/GovDataHub/open-data-index
    description: "GitHub repository"
repository-code: "https://github.com/GovDataHub/open-data-index"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23308617
abstract: >-
  Curated, living catalogs of open government datasets across climate &
  energy and economy & small business, harvested from data.gov (US),
  data.gov.uk (UK), Socrata, Zenodo, Hugging Face, EIA, FRED, and
  national CKAN portals (Canada, Australia, Argentina, Mexico). Every
  entry is license-verified (US public domain, public domain, CC0,
  CC-BY, UK Open Government Licence v3.0, Open Government Licence –
  Canada family) before publication. Provided as CSV and JSON, one row
  per dataset.
keywords:
  - open-data
  - data-catalog
  - open-government-data
  - climate-data
  - energy-data
  - economics
  - civic-tech
  - data-journalism
